            "reviewBody": "I just made this but knew I would make a couple of changes since I was trying to recreate a specific kidney bean salad from a small delicatessen near our IL home. I omitted the boiled egg and added about 2/3 stalk of minced celery to the halved recipe. Only my Dad and I will eat this so cut the recipe in half. Tastes excellent already and anticipate it will be even better after a day or so of resting in the frig.",
